==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Shining Legends|Qwilfish|21}} from the {{TCG|Shining Legends}} expansion; both cards have the {{m|Poison Sting}} attack.
*{{m|Poison Sting}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Qwilfish}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

